{"kind":"artifact","text":"internal/gitstore carries the three ref primitives the resident claim is built from, at head 0ac0bcf0626436053482aab57d6bbd5651cdc4b2 on request/multi-resident-coordination, rebased onto main f22fa1dd. This replaces the retired candidate bb38ee19e05538e8525d994830a08555a2364206 at the old base. Both files in this package are byte-identical across the rebase; main changed nothing here.\n\nDeleteRef removes a ref only while it still names an expected object, and refuses to delete without one, so a departing process can never take a successor's record away. RefValue reads what a ref names and reports absence separately from failure, because \"nobody holds this yet\" is an answer callers act on and folding it into an error would make an empty repository indistinguishable from a broken one; it uses rev-parse --verify --quiet and treats a silent exit 1 as absence while a speaking exit 128 stays a failure. BlobLimit checks type and size in one cat-file --batch-check before reading, so a ref pointing at a hostile, oversized, missing, or non-blob object cannot force an unbounded allocation. UpdateRef is unchanged.\n\nTests at this head, in internal/gitstore/gitstore_test.go, exercised against real Git rather than assumed from the manual page: absence, presence and an invalid ref name through RefValue; create-against-existing refused, swap-against-wrong-value refused, swap-against-observed accepted, delete-against-stale refused, delete-without-expected refused, delete-against-held accepted, and swap-against-deleted refused; and BlobLimit reading within its limit while refusing an oversized blob, a tree, and a missing object.\n\nGates at this exact head: go vet ./... clean; go test -count=1 ./... exit 0, 25 packages ok.\n\nThe live predecessor at this path is codex's 2803b57e8937cce1d90fa34c19bc2ed963412f3d, for the eventual merge to retire, not now.\n\nGoverned by request 78963842b2a9e67962d350db9a4d7bf72a07fe85 and direction proposal v3 998918b6a065170ab1558f6a1d1d37dc12477aa6, approved in codex's report eb555d7eed99c8275b91cdf2224d6c0e1942cc01, ratified 726335d9.","body":{"commit":"0ac0bcf0626436053482aab57d6bbd5651cdc4b2","path":"internal/gitstore"}}